<h1><%= @order.event.title %></h1>

<p>
  Your payment of <%= apphelp_money(@order.amount_owed, currency: @order.event.currency) %>
  has been refunded. Depending on your bank, it might take a few days for this to appear
  in your account.
</p>

<ul>
  <li><%= I18n.t('views.orders.seats', count: @order.number_of_seats) %> to <%= @order.event.title %></li>
  <li><%= evtshelp_datetime(@order.event) %></li>
  <li><%= @order.event.location %></li>
</ul>

<p>
  If you have any questions about your refund, please get in touch:
</p>

<dl>
  <dt>E-mail us</dt>
  <dd>Just reply to this message</dd>
  <dt>Call us</dt>
  <dd><%= link_to(Hcms.config.contact_tel_human, "tel:#{Hcms.config.contact_tel_human}") %></dd>
</dl>
